      "name": "Heavily Augmented",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "inqActor05Trait0",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Inquisitorial Autosavant has Augmetic Sensory Organs, Calculus Logi Upgrade, Interface Port, and Scribe Tines.  Bureaucratic Boldness: The Inquisitorial Autosavant has a Resolve of 3 whenever dealing with paperwork, tithes, or any other bureaucratic conversation.  Constantly Documenting: If the Inquisitorial Autosavant is capable of witnessing the actions the enemy take during combat for two turns in a row, they lower the enemy's Superiority by 1.  Data Delver: The Inquisitorial Autosavant has Advantage on Tests made to find or retrieve information from a document or archive (whether analog or digital).  Calculus Logi Upgrade: The Inquisitorial Autosavant gains +1 SL on any Logic (Mathematics) tests and gains +5 Intelligence.  Interface Port: The Inquisitorial Autosavant gains +10 to all Lore or Tech Tests whilst connected to a relevant mechanism or data spool.</p>"
        },
